  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Her first love died in a carriage accident. Irina still misses him,\nbut she is forced into a political marriage. On top of that, the other person is her dead first love's twin brother, Duke Schneider.\n\nIrina resents him for proposing and forcing her into marriage without permission, and vows never to open her heart.\n\n\"I still love Michael.\"\n\"It doesn't matter.\"\n\"What...?\"\n\"It doesn't matter. Whoever you like.\"\n\nA year after marriage.\n\n\"I won't hide it anymore since it's come to this. I like you.\"\n\nHe starts to reveal his true feelings. With such boldness that Irina is shaken. However, Irina didn't realize at the time that she was being deceived by her husband... \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66180247), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%A8%ED%8E%B8%EC%9D%B4-%EC%B2%AB%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91%EC%9D%84-%EB%8B%AE%EC%95%98%EB%8B%A4/4424)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/182908)",
